      "ts": "2026-02-11T00:32:50.446-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "thought\nTURN 8! MY TURN!\nUPKEEP.\nUntapped lands: 11!\nWait, I have 12 lands total?\nBattlefield showed 12. 11 untapped (maybe 1 is a tapped-entry land or I used 1 already?).\nMana pool: Empty.\n\n\"REVEILLE! WAKE UP MAGGOTS! THE SUN IS UP AND SO ARE WE! UNTAP! RELOAD!\"\n\nStack:\nDamia trigger is likely on the stack or about to be.\n\"At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have fewer than seven cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference.\"\nHand:\n- Spell Crumple\n- Mulldrifter\n- Desecrator Hag\n- Shared Trauma\n- Minds Aglow\nTotal: 5 cards.\nDamia will draw me 2 cards.\n\nChoices:\n- Troll Ascetic (Regen).\n- I could play spells? No, it's Upkeep. I can play Instants.\n- Do I want to cast `Shared Trauma` or `Minds Aglow` now?\n- Probably not. Keep mana for the main phase.\n\n\"TROLL! KEEP YOUR HEAD DOWN! NO NEED TO REGENERATE YET, THE COAST IS CLEAR!\"\n\nWait, I should check if I want to play anything *before* drawing?\nIf I play a card, Damia will draw me one more.\nBut these cards are valuable. I don't want to just dump them.\n`Shared Trauma`: Mill X. Everyone mills X.\nMimeoplasm likes grav-y-ards.\n\"MAGGOTS! DUMP THE BODIES!\"\nBut wait, if I mill 5, but I lose my hand, is it worth it?\nI have 11 mana.\nIf I cast `Shared Trauma` for X=5 (leaving 5 mana for Crumple/Hag), I'd mill 5.\nThen Damia would draw me 3 cards instead of 2.\nIs milling 5 worth 1 card + the mana?\nMaybe later. I want to see what I draw first.\n\nActually, I have 0 choices except Troll.\nI'll pass.\n`choose_action(answer=false)`\n`pass_priority()`\n`get_action_choices()`\n\nNext: Draw Phase -> Main 1.\n\"",
