      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "thought\n\"LAND SECURED! TEMPLE OF THE FALSE GOD IS ONLINE! DISMISSED!\"\nI have 12 untapped lands (including the Temple).\nActually, the Temple untaps when played? Or I have 12 now.\n\nOptions:\n1. `Tribute to the Wild` (1G): \"Each opponent sacrifices an artifact or enchantment.\"\nSonnet Stoic has: `Sol Ring`, `Mind Stone`, `Unstable Obelisk`, `Warlock Class`, `Share the Spoils`.\nTimmy has: `Sol Ring`, `Wild Growth` (on Forest), `Sungrass Prairie` (land), `Fertile Ground` (on land), `Sword of Hours`, `Holy Avenger`.\nThis card is GREAT. It hits both opponents.\n\"ARTILLERY! TAKE OUT THEIR EQUIPMENT! FIRE!\"\n\n2. `Mulldrifter` (4U): Draw 2 cards.\nFlying 2/2.\n\"MORE INTEL! WE NEED EYES IN THE SKY!\"\n\n3. `Desecrator Hag` (4 mana): Return creature from graveyard to hand.\nGraveyard: `Skullbriar`, `Fact or Fiction`, `Yavimaya Elder`, `Brawn`, `Acidic Slime`, `Solemn Simulacrum`, `Lhurgoyf`.\nAcidic Slime would be great for more destruction.\nSolemn for more lands.\n\"RECOVER THE FALLEN! ACIDIC SLIME, GET BACK IN THE RANKS!\"\n\n4. `Prognostic Sphinx` (from exile? index 2):\nWait, who owns the Sphinx?\nEarlier state: `Gem25F Timmy: exile [Fey Steed, Prognostic Sphinx]`.\nStoic has `Share the Spoils`.\n\"Whenever a player plays a land or casts a card from exile, they may play a land or cast a spell from the cards exiled with Share the Spoils.\"\nWait, if Sphinx is in Timmy's exile because of `Share the Spoils`, I can cast it!\n4/4 Flyer, Ward 3, Scry 3 on attack.\n\"THAT SPHINX LOOKS LIKE IT HAS THE ANSWERS! GET IT ON OUR SIDE!\"\n\nStrategy:\nStoic is the clear threat (Prosper engine).\nTimmy is struggling (21 HP).\nI want to disrupt Stoic.\n`T",
