    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:04:48.008-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "START RECRUITING, YOU MAGGOTS!\n\nListen up! Two of our enemies have already deserted the field, but Sonnet Stoic is still standing there with a fancy name and a board full of treasures and thopters. We've got the muscle, but they've got blockers for days.\n\nLife check:\n- Me: 34 HP (Healthy enough for a forced march)\n- Sonnet Stoic: 39 HP (Too much! We need to trim that fat!)\n\nOur Squad:\n- **Lhurgoyf (8/9)**: A big pile of bones. Move out!\n- **Vorosh, the Hunter (6/6)**: Get in the air and dive-bomb 'em!\n- **Troll Ascetic (3/2)**: Don't you dare die on me.\n- **Fleshbag Marauder (3/1)** and **Desecrator Hag (2/2)**: Move your lazy hides!\n\nEnemy Squad:\n- Prosper (1/4), Witch (2/2), Sorcerer (4/3), Fiend (3/3), Daredevil (2/1), Apprentice (2/1).\n- They have a lot of garbage to throw in front of our Lhurgoyf.\n\nWe're going to send the whole lot. If they block, they lose their value engines. If they don't, they feel the pain.\n\n**ALL ATTACK! MOVE IT!**\n\n(Wait, I see \"ALL ATTACK\" is index 5. Let's send them all at Sonnet Stoic.)\n\nThinking: Sonnet Stoic is the only opponent left alive (Haiku Villain and Gem25F Timmy are out). \n\nI'll select All Attack.\n\nPlan:\n1. Select All Attack (index 5).\n2. Confirm combat.\n\nLet's go.\n\n",
      "toolCalls": [
        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"index\":5}"
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "promptTokens": 5952,
        "completionTokens": 424
      },
      "costUsd": 0.004248
    },
    {
