      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:13:22.718-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "FALL IN! THE ENEMY IS ADVANCING!\n\n**Dream Pillager** and two **Thopters** are buzzing in. The Pillager is the real threat—if it connects, Stoic gets more cards to play!\n\n\"WREXIAL! YOU'RE THE BIGGEST THING IN THE WATER! EAT THAT PILLAGER! DAMIA, VOROSH, STAND DOWN! WE DON'T NEED THE WHOLE REGIMENT TO SWAT A FEW FLIES!\"\n\nWait... the thopters are 1/1 flyers. Dream Pillager is 4/4 flyer. \nI have:\n- **Vorosh (6/6 flying)**\n- **Damia (4/4 deathtouch, no flying)**\n- **Wrexial (5/8, no flying)**\n- **Avatar of Woe (6/5 fear, no flying)**\n\nWait, Damia, Wrexial, and Avatar DON'T have flying. They CANNOT block flyers!\n\n\"VOROSH! YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE WITH WINGS! GET UP THERE AND TEAR THAT DREAM PILLAGER OUT OF THE SKY! THE REST OF YOU... JUST STAND THERE AND LOOK USELESS LIKE USUAL!\"\n\n1. Select **Vorosh (index 0)**.\n2. Select **Dream Pillager** to block.\n3. Confirm.\n\nThinking:\nIf I block the 4/4 with my 6/6, Vorosh lives and the Pillager dies. \nThe 2 Thopters will hit me for 2 damage. I'll go to 18. That's fine.\n\nWait, I should check if Stoic has any mana to pump or trick. \nHe has {R:1} floating and several untapped lands/rocks. Including a Treasure Token. \nHe could have a trick, but I have to block that Pillager. \n\nDO IT!\n\nWait, I should check if I want to block a thopter too. No, I don't have any other flyers!\n\nWait... I just realized I only have Vorosh to block.\n\n1. get_action_choices\n2. index 0 (Vorosh)\n3. index 0 (Dream Pillager)\n4. answer=true (confirm)\n\nMOVE!\n\n(Wait, I'll call get_action_choices first.)\n\n",
