      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"GOODBYE, PROSPER! DON'T LET THE TOMES HIT YOU ON THE WAY OUT!\"\n\nNow, I let the Damia trigger resolve and draw my cards.\n\n\"DAMIA! REPORT! I WANT FOUR NEW RECRUITS IN MY HAND IMMEDIATELY!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=false) to pass and let the stack resolve.\n\nI'll check the game state after the draw to see my new resources.\n\nWait, it's UPKEEP. I haven't drawn for turn yet.\nDamia trigger happens at beginning of upkeep. \nThen I draw for turn. \nSo I should end up with a full hand of 8 cards (if Damia trigger gives me 7 and then I draw for turn).\n\nActually, Damia says: \"if you have fewer than seven cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference.\"\nCurrent hand: 3 cards.\nI'll draw 4 cards.\nThen Draw Step.\nTotal hand size will be 8.\n\nPASS!\n\nWait, I should check if I have anything else to do. No.\n\n\"RELAX YOUR TRIGGER FINGERS! LET THE LADY DO HER WORK!\"\n\npass_priority.\n\n",
