      "reasoning": "\"OH, NOW WE'RE TALKING! LOOK AT THESE BEAUTIES!\"\n\nSelection for Buried Alive (Need 3):\n1. **Wonder** - Flying for the whole squad. Essential. (Index 14)\n2. **Butcher of Malakir** - Whenever our creatures die, Stoic loses creatures. (Index 0)\n3. **Artisan of Kozilek** - 10/10 body for Mimeoplasm, or cast it later for recursion. (Index 12)\n\nAlternatively: \n- **Lord of Extinction**? (Not in the list? No, I see **Sewer Nemesis** and **Mortivore**. They are similar.)\n- **Sewer Nemesis** - Huge power/toughness based on grave. Good for Mimeoplasm. (Index 13)\n- **Szadek, Lord of Secrets** - Mills equal to damage. (Index 3)\n\nLet's go with:\n- **Wonder** (Index 14) - Get us in the air!\n- **Butcher of Malakir** (Index 0) - Board control.\n- **Artisan of Kozilek** (Index 12) - THE BIG GUN.\n\nWait, check **Sewer Nemesis** (Index 13). It will be huge. \nBut **Wonder** is the highest priority. \n\n\"WONDER! JOIN THE CORPS! ARTISAN! BUTCHER! GET IN THE PLANE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=14)\n2. get_action_choices\n3. choose_action(index=0)\n4. get_action_choices\n5. choose_action(index=12)\n\n(The system will ask me to select them one by one.)\n\n\"MOVE MOVE MOVE!\"\n\nWait, I should check if **Lord of Extinction** is in the graveyard already? No. \nIs **Mortivore** better? Mortivore is based on all graveyards. \nArtisan is a guaranteed 10/10. \n\nLet's go.\n\n",
