      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"MISSION ACCOMPLISHED! THE RECRUITS ARE IN THE DIRT! READY FOR REANIMATION!\"\n\nNow, let's keep the momentum going. **Sign in Blood** (Index 1). \nDraw 2 more cards.\n\n\"SERGEANT! WE NEED MORE INTEL! SIGN THIS IN BLOOD!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=1)\n\nThen we'll see our targets for the Sign. (Ourselves, obviously).\n\nWait, check mana. 12 untapped lands. Plenty. \n\n\"MOVE OUT!\"\n\nAfter Sign in Blood, if I draw anything useful like **Mimeoplasm** or **Reanimate**, we're in business.\n\nWait, I should check the Unknown (df87e62c) card too. \nWait, the unknown card in `get_action_choices` usually means it's a card I just drew.\n\nLet's cast Sign in Blood first.\n\n\"DON'T BE A COWARD! IT'S JUST A NICK!\"\n\nWait, index 1 is Sign in Blood.\n\nfyi: Sign in Blood costs {B}{B}.\n\n1. choose_action(index=1)\n\n(actually, index 1 in the current choices list IS Sign in Blood).\n\nwait, I need to check the game state after the draw.\n\n\"YES SIR!\"\n\n",
