      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:15:14.800-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"REINFORCEMENTS HAVE ARRIVED!\"\n\nAlright, I drew **Sewer Nemesis**! And a mystery card.\nWait, I already sent Artisan and Butcher to the yard. \n\nCurrent status:\nMe: 12 HP. \nStoic: 27 HP. \nMy field: Vorosh (6/6), Wrexial (5/8), Damia (4/4), Avatar of Woe (6/5).\nAll have Flying now thanks to Wonder (assuming I have an Island, which I definitely do).\n\nWait! **Wonder** works from the graveyard!\n\"As long as Wonder is in your graveyard and you control an Island, creatures you control have flying.\"\nI have an Island!\nI have **Brawn** in the yard! Trample!\nI have **Damia** (Deathtouch)!\n\nSo I have a 6/6 Flying Trample Dragon, a 5/8 Flying Trample Kraken (Landwalk too), etc. \n\n\"WE ARE THE GODS OF THE SKY AND THE LAND, MAGGOTS!\"\n\nStoic has **Riddlekeeper** (1/4). \nIf I attack with everything, he mills me for 8.\nI have plenty of cards in library (52). \n\nStrategic evaluation:\nShould I cast **Sewer Nemesis**?\nCosts {3}{B}. 0/0. \"As Sewer Nemesis enters the battlefield, choose a player. Sewer Nemesis's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in the chosen player's graveyard.\"\nStoic has 16 cards in graveyard. \nSo it's a 16/16. \n\n\"SEWER NEMESIS! GET YOUR SMELLY BUTT OVER HERE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\nThen I'll choose Stoic.\n\nWait, I should also see what else I can do. \n**Simic Signet**? I have plenty of mana.\n**Minds Aglow**? NO.\n**Shared Trauma**? NO.\n\nLet's cast Sewer Nemesis.\n\n\"SQUASH THEM LIKE BUGS!\"\n\nWait, index 3 is Sewer Nemesis.\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\n(Actually, check the unknown card index 0 first? No, Sewer Nemesis is a solid 1",
      "usage": {
        "promptTokens": 9807,
        "completionTokens": 512
      },
      "costUsd": 0.006439
