      "reasoning": "\"STILL IN PRECOMBAT MAIN? I SAID MOVE TO COMBAT!\"\n\nThe priority player is Sonnet Stoic. I need to wait for him to pass.\n\n\"PULL YOURSELF TOGETHER! SONNET STOIC IS DAWDLEING!\"\n\nWait, Stoic has **Hellish Rebuke** in exile.\nIf he can cast it with **Izzet Chemister**...\nIzzet Chemister: \"{1}{R}, {T}, Exile an instant or sorcery card from your graveyard.\"\nWait, Hellish Rebuke is in EXILE, not graveyard. \nIzzet Chemister's second ability: \"{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Izzet Chemister: You may cast any number of cards exiled with Izzet Chemister without paying their mana costs. X is the number of cards cast this way.\"\nHe hasn't exiled anything with it yet. \n\n\"THE COAST IS CLEAR! ATTACK!\"\n\nWait, I need to pass priority to Stoic, then he passes back.\n\n\"HURRY UP, SONNET!\"\n\n1. pass_priority.\n\nHand: Minds Aglow, Shared Trauma, Forest, Forest.\nMana floating: {C:1, G:1, U:2}. \nUntapped permanents: Dimir Signet, Dimir Aqueduct, Simic Signet, Command Tower, Vorosh, Damia, Wrexial, Sewer Nemesis.\n\nAfter he passes, I'll go to Combat.\nVorosh (6/6), Damia (4/4), Wrexial (5/8).\nAll have Flying (Wonder) and Trample (Brawn).\nSewer Nemesis (16/16) has summoning sickness.\n\n\"VETERANS! CHARGE!\"\n\n1. pass_priority.\n\n(Actually, I should check if I want to use Wrexial's ability if he hits? Stoic's yard has: Danse Macabre, Hex, Commune with Lava, Bituminous Blast, Terminate...)\nDanse Macabre? Hex? \nIf Wrexial hits, I can cast **Hex**!\n\"Destroy up to six target creatures.\"\nHe only has 4 creatures. I could wipe his board!\n\n\"WREXIAL! YOU HAVE YOUR ORDERS! FIND THAT HEX!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\n(Wait, the game state says Stoic",
