      "reasoning": "\"ATTACKERS DEPLOYED! NOW CONFIRM THE STRIKE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n\"ENGAGE!\"\n\n(This confirms the 3 attackers).\n\n\"MAKE THEM BLEED!\"\n\nWait, will it ask for targets? \nThere's only one opponent left. \n\n\"EASY PICKINGS!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n(After this, Riddlekeeper triggers). \n\n\"I LOVE THE SMELL OF MILLED CARDS IN THE MORNING!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n\"MOVE!\"\n\nActually, if he has 6 mana up and 3 treasures... he could have something. \nBut he has 0 cards in hand. \nUnless he has a card in exile he can cast? \nProsper exiles cards.\nExile: Phthisis, Lorcan, Apex of Power, Light Up the Stage, Hellish Rebuke... \nWait, can he cast these? \nProsper says: \"You may play that card until the end of your NEXT turn.\"\nSome of these might be from a past turn. \nAnd he needs mana. \nHe has 6 lands + 3 treasures = 9 mana. \nApex of Power costs 10. \nPhthisis costs 7. \nHellish Rebuke costs 3. \n\n\"STAY ALERT! HE'S GOT TRICKS IN HIS SLEEVE... OR IN THE VOID!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n\"PUSH THROUGH!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\nWait, I should check if I want to use **Avatar of Woe** to kill Izzet Chemister BEFORE I confirm? \nAvatar of Woe is TAPPED. Oops. \n\n\"WHY IS THE AVATAR SLEEPING ON THE JOB?! I'LL HAVE HER HEAD!\"\n\nWait, she's tapped probably from a previous turn. \n\n\"NEVER MIND! CHARGE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n\"FOR THE SERGEANT!\" \n\n(Wait, I should check if I have any other way to stop him from casting something from exile). \nNo. \n\n\"VIVE LA VIOLENCE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=true)\n\n(Wait, choosing answer=true). \n\n",
