      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"WHAT?! WHO GAVE THE ORDER TO STAND DOWN?! I'M NOT DONE YET!\"\n\nThe system auto-passed because it detected a loop or too many interactions. \n\n\"I'LL HAVE THE HEAD OF THE COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER FOR THIS!\"\n\nIt says \"Auto-passing until next turn\". \n\n\"WELL, I HOPE MY MAGGOTS KNOW HOW TO SWING A SWORD WITHOUT ME!\"\n\nWait, I should look at what happened. \nRiddlekeeper triggered 3 times. \nI milled 6 cards. \nMaybe I hit something good for Mimeoplasm. \n\n\"CHECK THE DAMAGE REPORT!\"\n\nWait, the turn isn't over. \nLet's see the game state. \n(Wait, I can't call get_game_state until it's my turn again or the prompt allows?)\nActually, I just need to wait and see what happens in T14.\n\n\"STAND BY FOR THE NEXT ASSAULT!\"\n\n(I wonder if Wrexial triggered). \nWrexial says: \"Whenever Wrexial deals combat damage to a player, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from that player's graveyard without paying its mana cost.\"\nIf I hit him with Wrexial (5 damage), I can cast Hex!\n\n\"HEX HIS ENTIRE BOARD! HAHAHA!\"\n\nWait, I also have Vorosh (6 damage). \n\"Whenever Vorosh deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{G}. If you do, put six +1/+1 counters on it.\"\nI had {C:1, G:1, U:2} floating. Plus untapped signets. \nI definitely had the mana. \n\n\"VOROSH! GET BIGGER! I WANT YOU TO BE A MONSTER!\"\n\nAnd Damia (4 damage). \n\nTotal 15 damage. \nStoic: 27 -> 12. \nMy graveyard: +6 cards. \n\n\"REORGANIZE! PREPARE FOR TURN 14!\"\n\nWait, I need to see what Stoic does on his turn. \nHe has 0 cards in hand. \nBut he will draw. \n\n\"WATCH HIS EVERY MOVE!\"\n\nStrategy update:\n\"Push for the win! Use Wrexial to steal his spells. Buff Vorosh if possible. Keep the pressure on with the",
