      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"CONTACT! INCOMING FIRE!\"\n\nStoic has activated **Unstable Obelisk**!\n\"Destroy target permanent.\"\nAnd **Fevered Suspicion** is rebounding!\n\"Each opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card. You may cast those cards without paying their mana costs. For each spell cast this way, create a 2/2 black Beholder creature token.\"\n\n\"MAN YOUR BATTLE STATIONS! THIS IS NOT A DRILL!\"\n\nThe Obelisk is on the stack. I need to see what it's targeting. \n(Targeting Vorosh? Damia? Wrexial?)\nWait, I already attacked! Stoic's life is 12! \nActually, the game state says `life: 12` for Stoic. \nSo they hit for 15. \nNow it's turn 13... wait, turn 13 for both? \nThe state says `turn: 13`.\nActive player: Sonnet Stoic. \nStep: Upkeep.\n\n\"UPKEEP?! WE JUST FINISHED OUR TURN! WHY ARE WE STILL AWAKE?!\"\n\nStoic is trying to blow something up on my board. \nAnd Fevered Suspicion is going to steal my cards.\n\n\"TRAITORS! TO YOUR OWN SHIPS!\"\n\nI have priority. I can't stop the Obelisk (except with mana? No). \nI can't stop Fevered Suspicion. \n\n\"GRIT YOUR TEETH, MAGGOTS! THIS IS GOING TO HURT!\"\n\nI'll pass priority. \n\n\"TAKE IT LIKE A SOLDIER!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\n(Wait, I should check if I have any responses. \nMinds Aglow? No. \nShared Trauma? No.\nActivated abilities? \nAvatar of Woe? Tapped. \nDimir Signet? Just mana. \nWait, I can tap my signets for mana if I need to?)\n\n\"SIT TIGHT! THE ENEMY IS FIRING!\"\n\n1. pass_priority.\n\nTarget of Unstable Obelisk:\nIf I check `target_count: 1`... it doesn't say what the target is in the summary. \n\n\"I'LL BET HEADQUARTERS IT'S VOROSH",
