      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:19:44.273-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"REINFORCEMENTS HAVE ARRIVED! AND THEY BROUGHT THE HEAVY ARTILLERY!\"\n\nIt's my turn 14. \nI drew **Grave Pact**, **Szadek, Lord of Secrets**, and **Svogthos, the Restless Tomb**. \n(Wait, Damia triggered at the beginning of my turn? \nHand size was 4. \nDamia says: \"At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have fewer than seven cards in your hand, draw cards equal to the difference.\"\nI drew 3 cards. \nTotal 7 cards in hand). \n\n\"GRAVE PACT! NOW THEY'LL PAY FOR EVERY DROP OF BLOOD!\"\n\nGrave Pact: \"Whenever a creature you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature.\"\n\n\"SZADEK! THE LORD OF SECRETS! HE'S GOING TO MILL THAT POET INTO OBLIVION!\"\n\nStoic is at 17 life. \nHe has Lorcan (7/7) in exile. \nHe has Consuming Vapors (REBOUNDing) on his next upkeep. \nWait, no. Rebound happened on HIS upkeep (Turn 13). \nSo it's gone now. \n\n\"THE VAPORS HAVE CLEARED! NOW WE STRIKE BACK!\"\n\nI have 16 untapped lands. \nGrave Pact (4 mana)\nSzadek (7 mana)\nSvogthos (Land)\n\n\"MAGGOTS! DEPLOY THE GRAVE PACT! I WANT THEM SACRIFICING THEIR KIN!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=0) (Grave Pact)\n\nThen I'll play Szadek. \n\n\"SZADEK! GET DOWN THERE AND START CHEWING!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=1) (Szadek)\n\nWait, I should play a land first? \nSvogthos, the Restless Tomb. \n\"Add {C}. {3}{B}{G}: Svogthos, the Restless Tomb becomes a black and green Plant Zombie creature with 'This creature's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard' until end of turn.\"\nMy graveyard is full of meat!\n\n1. choose_action(index=3) (Svogthos)\n\n\"AND THE FOREST!",
