      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"SZADEK HAS LANDED! MAGGOTS, WIPE THE DROOL OFF YOUR CHINS!\"\n\nNow for the land. \n\n\"SVOGTHOS! RISE! THAT IS AN ORDER!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3) (Svogthos)\n\n\"AND THE FORESTS! NO, WAIT, I ONLY HAVE ONE LAND DROP! SVOGTHOS IS THE PRIORITY!\"\n\nWait, can I play more? \nNo, one land per turn. \n\n\"THE REST OF YOU FLOWERS CAN STAY IN THE PACK! MOVING TO COMBAT!\"\n\nWait, I should check if I want to play **Minds Aglow** or **Shared Trauma**. \nNo, I'm at 10 life. Stoic has Lorcan. \nI need to keep mana for blockers or something? \nWait, I have no mana left after I finish my main phase. \n\n\"ATTACK! SHOW THEM NO MERCY!\"\n\n1. choose_action(answer=false)\n\n(To end main phase). \n\n\"VOROSH! WREXIAL! DAMIA! CHARGE!\"\n\nWait, I'll check my creatures first. \nVorosh (6/6 Flying). \nWrexial (5/8 Swampwalk/Islandwalk). \nDamia (4/4 Deathtouch). \nSzadek (5/5 Flying) - summoning sickness. \n\nStoic has: \nLorcan (6/6 Flying). \nThopter (1/1 Flying) x2. \nRiddlekeeper (1/4). \nIzzet Chemister (1/3). \nTreasures (1). \n\nRiddlekeeper: \"Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, its controller mills two cards.\"\nI've got a Gravesite to fill! No problem! \n\n\"MILL AWAY, POET! MY GRAVEYARD IS A FRUITFUL GARDEN!\"\n\nAttack with all. \nWrexial has Swampwalk/Islandwalk. Stoic HAS Swamps and Mountains. \nIslandwalk works if he has an Island? No, he has Mountains and Swamps. \nWait, his lands: Mountain, Swamp, Mountain, Zhalfirin Void, Command Tower, Mountain, Swamp, Swamp, Swamp... \nHe has Swamps! \nWrexial is UNBLOCKABLE! ",
