      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:21:23.762-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"ALL SYSTEMS GREEN! SZADEK HAS CLEARED THE DECK!\"\n\nPriority with Stoic. \nWait, why is it still Precombat Main? \nI passed priority, but Stoic also has priority. \n\n\"POET! GET ON WITH IT! I'VE GOT A WAR TO WIN!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\n(Wait, I'll check my board. \nVorosh, Wrexial, Damia are ready. \nSzadek has sickness. \n\nStoic has Lorcan. \nIf I attack, I want to kill Lorcan. \nHe has 17 life. \nWrexial (5) is unblockable (Swampwalk). \nDamia (4) has Deathtouch. \nVorosh (6) has Flying. \n\nIf I attack with all: \nWrexial hits for 5. (12 life). \nVorosh blocked by Lorcan? Both die. \nGrave Pact triggers! He sacs something else. \nDamia blocked by Thopter? Thopter dies. \n\n\"I LOVE THE SMELL OF DEATHTOUCH IN THE MORNING!\"\n\nActually, I should check if he'll play anything in my main phase. \nHe has no cards in hand. \nHe has 0 priority actions other than abilities? \nHe has **Rakdos Signet** untapped. \nHe has **Treasure Token** untapped. \n\n\"FORWARD! MOVE! MOVE! MOVE!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\n(Wait, call it). \n\n\"MAGGOTS! FALL IN!\"\n\n1. pass_priority.\n\nWait, I should check if I can play anything else. \nNo. \n\n\"HUP-TWO-THREE-FOUR!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\nWait, this is my turn. \nI passed priority for the main phase. \nIt should go to Combat. \n\n\"DISMISS THE MAIN PHASE! ATTACK!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\nWait, call it. \n\nActually, I'll check the combat math again. \nIf I kill Lorcan, Stoic's engine stops. \nGrave Pact is the key. \n\n\"GRAVE PACT IS THE ENFORCER! DO YOUR JOB!\"\n\n1. pass_priority. \n\n",
