      "ts": "2026-02-11T01:21:30.846-08:00",
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"MAGGOTS! THE TIME HAS COME! SHOW THAT POET WHAT A REAL VERSE LOOKS LIKE!\"\n\n\"ALL ATTACK! NO ONE LEFT BEHIND!\"\n\nWait, can I skip Damia? \nNo, I have Grave Pact. \nIf she dies, he sacs. \nShe has Deathtouch. \nHe might not even block her. \n\n\"VOROSH! WREXIAL! DAMIA! CRUSH THEM!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3) (All attack)\n\n\"Riddlekeeper\" will mill me 6 cards. \n\"GOOD! MY GRAVEYARD WAS LOOKING A BIT THIN!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\n\"TAKE NO PRISONERS!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\nWait, I should check the Riddlekeeper text. \n\"Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, its controller mills two cards.\"\n3 creatures = 6 cards. \n\n\"I CAN MILL SIX CARDS IN MY SLEEP!\"\n\nWait, I'll call it. \n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\n\"UNLEASH THE BEASTS!\"\n\nActually, I should check if Szadek can attack next turn? Yes. \nHe has sickness now. \n\n\"MOVE! MOVE! MOVE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\nWait, why am I still talking? \n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\nWait, if I select all, does it move to resolution? \nI have to call get_action_choices after toggling if I don't use 'All Attack'. \nBut index 3 is 'All attack'. \n\n\"EYES ON THE PRIZE!\"\n\n1. choose_action(index=3)\n\nWait, call it. \n\nWait, check the board one last time. \nLorcan is summoning sick! \n`summoning_sickness: true`. \n\n\"HA! THE DEMON IS ASLEEP ON THE JOB! PATHETIC!\"\n\nHe can't block with Lorcan! \n\n\"FREE DAMAGE! THE BEST KIND!\"\n\nHe has two Thopters (1/1). \nHe has Riddlekeeper (1/4). \nHe has Izzet Chemister (1/3). \nTotal life: 17.",
