      "description": "Cast Chittering Witch before playing a land drop. They had Mountain and Swamp in hand and could have played one first to have 5 mana available instead of 4, which would be relevant for Chittering Witch's activated ability ({1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature) if needed during opponents' turns.",
      "actionTaken": "Cast Chittering Witch without first making a land drop",
