    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fetching Forest when Plains would provide better color balance. With Plains from fetch + Forest from hand on turn 2, Timmy would have access to G, W, and U immediately, enabling earlier Fleecemane Lion and Angelic Gift. With Forest, white mana is delayed until Sungrass Prairie (which costs 1 to activate, effectively delaying GW access).",
