    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Karazikar before playing a land from hand. Sonnet Stoic has a Swamp and Mountain in hand and only 3 lands on the battlefield. Playing a land first is free and would leave them with 4 lands after casting Karazikar instead of 3 (with a land drop still available but all mana tapped).",
