      "description": "Player had enough mana to cast both Fleecemane Lion (GW) and Sword of Hours (2) this turn, but only cast Fleecemane Lion. With Sol Ring (CC), Forest+Wild Growth (GG), Island (U), and Sungrass Prairie (1+T: GW), there was plenty of mana to deploy both. Additionally, they should play Lumbering Falls (the Unknown choice) as their land drop before casting spells.",
