    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Should have played the Swamp from hand before casting the creature to have 6 mana available. Additionally, Yavimaya Elder is likely the stronger play here - in a multiplayer game on turn 4, the land ramp and card draw from Elder provides more long-term value than a 3/2 hexproof body. Elder dying to Karazikar-forced attacks would actually be beneficial, fetching 2 lands.",
