    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem25F Timmy has Fleecemane Lion in hand (GW, 3/3) and has the mana to cast it (Forest + Wild Growth for GG, Sungrass Prairie + 1 for GW, Sol Ring for CC). They have 5+ mana available and could cast Fleecemane Lion and equip Sword of Hours to it (equip cost 2). Instead they passed without deploying any threats. Fleecemane Lion is an excellent creature that can later become hexproof/indestructible, and with Sword of Hours already on board, getting a creature out to equip it to is important. Even just casting the Lion alone would develop the board meaningfully.",
